cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Baleen in research, teaching or a publication, please cite it as below."
title: "Baleen: a media-monitoring workbench for public financial disclosures"
abstract: >-
  Baleen ingests public disclosure feeds (US House and Senate periodic
  transaction reports, SEC EDGAR Form 4 filings and delayed CBOE option
  chains), extracts typed events, resolves entities into a Neo4j knowledge
  graph, and exposes the result through a grounded natural-language query
  interface, rule-based alerts and generated reports. It is intended as a
  reproducible engineering testbed for monitoring pipelines that must stay
  traceable to primary sources.
authors:
